cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the software release below and the
  accompanying paper given as the preferred citation.
type: software
title: "EFT_Operator_Scan: an effective-operator scan and sensitivity-mapping
  code for photon-dark matter elastic scattering"
abstract: >-
  Computes gamma-chi elastic-scattering optical depths for an effective-operator
  basis of dimension 5-7 dipole and Rayleigh operators (and their UV
  completions), builds chi-squared and f_required sensitivity maps against
  Fermi-LAT gamma-ray spectra, and generates the figures of the accompanying
  paper.
